The reusability as well as the adsorptive performance of adsorbents is very important in practical application. As shown in Fig. 8, comparing with the uptake capacity of the original fresh H-UiO-66-17.3 nm, there is almost no change of that of regenerated H-MOF after four cycles, confirming H-UiO-66-17.3 nm is a recyclable adsorbent for TC adsorption.
